<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114719" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῖσμα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρίω</span>) later form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῖμα</span> (q.v.), found in codd. of <i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>Smp.</u>
			2.4
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>An.</u>
			4.4.13
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>Od.</u>
			8
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			15
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Sor.
			1.4
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			6.402
		</span></i>, etc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anointing, unction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				29.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				35.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.892
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			<u>NT</u> of spiritual <i>grace,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῖσμα ἔχετε ἀπὸ τοῦ ἁγίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Jo.</u>
					2.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>coating</i> of wall, <i>plaster,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				62
			</span></i>. (The usual accent <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρίσμα</span>
			is wrong, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῖμα.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
